---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Plate from '@198x-ui/components/Plate.astro';
---

<BaseLayout>
  <main>
    <Plate prefix="debug" project="debug" size={40} />
    <h1>One debug format, every 198x tool.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Debug198x is the shared debug-information format: what the assembler emits, what the emulator reads, and what a source-level debugger needs in between.</p>
    <p class="status">Specified and emitting; the format freeze waits on the Emu198x importer.</p>
    <footer>
      One of the <a href="https://github.com/debug198x">198x family</a>. The
      wordmark, palette and type come from <a href="https://github.com/stevehill1981/198x-ui">198x-ui</a>.
    </footer>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
